  "description": "Ji-Heon, who makes a living by working part-time jobs, appears in front of Do-Kyung, who he considered like a younger brother when he was young, but with whom he lost contact due to his sudden overseas study. Ji-Heon, who accepted Do-kKung's suggestion to have a drink, loses consciousness and collapses... When he comes to, he finds himself tied up by Do-Kyung. \n\n*\"But hyung... shouldn't you be thinking about something more important than this?\"*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Daiwon's Neungyonk BL Danpyeon (능욕BL단편) Collection.*",
